*> Entity models part 9, section 18 worn equipment (docs/protocol/34-entity-models-9-non-living-entities.md): the elytra and the shield models.
*>   EF9-M-ELYTRA (texture 64 x 32), EF9-M-SHIELD (texture 64 x 64) USING model; the baby elytra is the elytra scaled by 0.5 (MeshTransformer.scaling, EMD-SCALE-ROOT);
*>   EF9-ELYTRA-ANIM USING model, IN(1 isCrouching, 2 elytraRotX, 3 elytraRotY, 4 elytraRotZ): the left wing gets y = 3 when crouching else 0, then the three state
*>     rotations, and the right wing mirrors it (yRot and zRot negated, y and xRot the same).

 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
 PROGRAM-ID. EF9-M-ELYTRA.
 DATA DIVISION.
 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
 01 WS-ROWS1.
    05 FILLER PIC X(100) VALUE "P left_wing root 5 0 0 0.2617994 0 -0.2617994".
    05 FILLER PIC X(100) VALUE "C left_wing 22 0 -10 0 0 10 20 2 1 0".
    05 FILLER PIC X(100) VALUE "P right_wing root -5 0 0 0.2617994 0 0.2617994".
    05 FILLER PIC X(100) VALUE "C right_wing 22 0 0 0 0 10 20 2 1 1".
    05 FILLER PIC X(100) VALUE SPACES OCCURS 76 TIMES.
 01 WS-ROWS1-R REDEFINES WS-ROWS1.
    05 WS-ROW1             PIC X(100) OCCURS 80 TIMES.
 01 WS-N1                  BINARY-LONG VALUE 4.
 01 WS-ZERO                FLOAT-LONG VALUE 0.
 LINKAGE SECTION.
 COPY CLEMM.
 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING EMM-MODEL.
     CALL "EMM-INIT" USING EMM-MODEL
     CALL "EM3-ROWS" USING EMM-MODEL WS-ROWS1-R WS-N1 WS-ZERO
     MOVE 64 TO MM-TEXW
     MOVE 32 TO MM-TEXH
     GOBACK.
 END PROGRAM EF9-M-ELYTRA.

 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
 PROGRAM-ID. EF9-M-SHIELD.
 DATA DIVISION.
 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
 01 WS-ROWS1.
    05 FILLER PIC X(100) VALUE "P plate root 0 0 0 0 0 0".
    05 FILLER PIC X(100) VALUE "C plate 0 0 -6 -11 -2 12 22 1 0 0".
    05 FILLER PIC X(100) VALUE "P handle root 0 0 0 0 0 0".
    05 FILLER PIC X(100) VALUE "C handle 26 0 -1 -3 -1 2 6 6 0 0".
    05 FILLER PIC X(100) VALUE SPACES OCCURS 76 TIMES.
 01 WS-ROWS1-R REDEFINES WS-ROWS1.
    05 WS-ROW1             PIC X(100) OCCURS 80 TIMES.
 01 WS-N1                  BINARY-LONG VALUE 4.
 01 WS-ZERO                FLOAT-LONG VALUE 0.
 LINKAGE SECTION.
 COPY CLEMM.
 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING EMM-MODEL.
     CALL "EMM-INIT" USING EMM-MODEL
     CALL "EM3-ROWS" USING EMM-MODEL WS-ROWS1-R WS-N1 WS-ZERO
     MOVE 64 TO MM-TEXW
     MOVE 64 TO MM-TEXH
     GOBACK.
 END PROGRAM EF9-M-SHIELD.

 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
 PROGRAM-ID. EF9-ELYTRA-ANIM.
 DATA DIVISION.
 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
 01 WS-NAME                PIC X(24).
 01 WS-L                   BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-R                   BINARY-LONG.
 LINKAGE SECTION.
 COPY CLEMM.
 01 L-IN.
    05 L-I                 FLOAT-LONG OCCURS 16 TIMES.
 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING EMM-MODEL L-IN.
     CALL "EMM-RESET" USING EMM-MODEL
     MOVE "left_wing" TO WS-NAME
     CALL "EMM-FIND" USING EMM-MODEL WS-NAME WS-L
     MOVE "right_wing" TO WS-NAME
     CALL "EMM-FIND" USING EMM-MODEL WS-NAME WS-R
     MOVE 0 TO MM-CY(WS-L)
     IF L-I(1) NOT = 0
         MOVE 3 TO MM-CY(WS-L)
     END-IF
     MOVE L-I(2) TO MM-CXROT(WS-L)
     MOVE L-I(4) TO MM-CZROT(WS-L)
     MOVE L-I(3) TO MM-CYROT(WS-L)
     COMPUTE MM-CYROT(WS-R) = 0 - MM-CYROT(WS-L)
     MOVE MM-CY(WS-L) TO MM-CY(WS-R)
     MOVE MM-CXROT(WS-L) TO MM-CXROT(WS-R)
     COMPUTE MM-CZROT(WS-R) = 0 - MM-CZROT(WS-L)
     GOBACK.
 END PROGRAM EF9-ELYTRA-ANIM.
